  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Morokei unleashes strangely colored fire...
  - Morokei rains down blue fire.
  - Morokei rains down orange fire.
  - Morokei unleashes a storm's worth of lightning.
  - Morokei increases the strength of gravity and whips around orange and blue fire.
  - Morokei unleashes blue swishes of fire along with fireballs.
  - Morokei unleashes orange swishes of fire along with fireballs.
