  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Morokei increases the strength of gravity and whips around orange and blue fire
    once more.
  - Morokei unleashes a storm's worth of lightning. Again.
  - Morokei unleashes multiple swishes of strangely colored fire once more.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who fires arrows from a bow.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who attempts to grasp at Yuri.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who fires arrows at the clumsy Sayori.
  - Morokei summons a particularly frosty undead ally.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who wields a great-axe.
